msgstr "スタンダード"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:9
msgid "No twist."
msgstr "ひねりなし。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:10
msgid "Gold Rush"
msgstr "ゴールドラッシュ"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:11
msgid "Six Gold blocks start on the board (+1 Credit per Gold cell cleared). +2 Credits if you win."
msgstr "ゴールドのブロック6つが盤面に置かれた状態で始まる(消えたゴールドのマス1つにつき+1クレジット)。勝てば+2クレジット。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:12
msgid "Tight Budget"
msgstr "緊縮予算"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:13
msgid "Three fewer placements. +4 Credits if you win."
msgstr "配置回数が3回少ない。勝てば+4クレジット。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:14
msgid "Rush Hour"
msgstr "ラッシュアワー"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:15
msgid "Target x0.8, but no Refresh this round."
msgstr "目標x0.8。ただしこのラウンドはリフレッシュなし。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:16
msgid "Double or Nothing"
msgstr "ダブルオアナッシング"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:17
msgid "Target x1.4. +6 Credits if you win."
msgstr "目標x1.4。勝てば+6クレジット。"

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/round_cards.gd:18 game/rules/resolver.gd:232
msgid "Mult Fever"
msgstr "倍率フィーバー"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:19
msgid "Every placement gets +1 Mult. Target x1.3."
msgstr "すべての配置が倍率+1。目標x1.3。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:20
msgid "Treasure Hunt"
msgstr "宝探し"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:21
msgid "Win to find a random item (needs a free item slot). Target x1.15."
msgstr "勝つとランダムなアイテムが見つかる(アイテム枠の空きが必要)。目標x1.15。"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:22
msgid "Scholarship"
msgstr "奨学金"

#: game/content/round_cards.gd:23
msgid "Win to level up the family of the last piece you place. Target x1.2."
msgstr "勝つと、最後に置いたピースのファミリーがレベルアップ。目標x1.2。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:82
msgid "Standard Kit"
msgstr "スタンダードキット"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:83
msgid "CLASSIC"
msgstr "クラシック"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:83
msgid "No twist: the rules as designed. The best Kit to learn with."
msgstr "ひねりなし:設計どおりのルール。覚えるのに一番いいキット。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:84
msgid "The 24-piece starter bag: a bit of every shape."
msgstr "24ピースのスターターバッグ:どの形も少しずつ。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:85
msgid "Compact"
msgstr "コンパクト"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:85
msgid "Compact Kit"
msgstr "コンパクトキット"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:86
msgid "+1 Credit for every Refresh you did not use when you win a round."
msgstr "ラウンドに勝ったとき、使わなかったリフレッシュ1回につき+1クレジット。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:86
msgid "THRIFT"
msgstr "倹約"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:87
msgid "An 18-piece bag of small pieces: Singles, Bars, little Ls and Squares. Only 4 Joker slots."
msgstr "小さいピース18個のバッグ:シングル、バー、小さいL、スクエア。ジョーカー枠は4つだけ。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:87
msgid "Clear 100 lines across runs."
msgstr "ラン通算で100ラインを消す。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:88
msgid "High Roller"
msgstr "ハイローラー"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:88
msgid "High Roller Kit"
msgstr "ハイローラーキット"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:89
msgid "COMPOUND INTEREST"
msgstr "複利"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:89
msgid "Interest can pay up to +3 more Credits each round."
msgstr "利子が毎ラウンド最大+3クレジット多くもらえる。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:90
msgid "Start with 4 Credits. The standard bag, 14 placements per round."
msgstr "4クレジットで開始。スタンダードのバッグで、ラウンドごとの配置は14回。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:90
msgid "Win a standard run."
msgstr "スタンダードのランに勝つ。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:91
msgid "Chunky"
msgstr "どっしり"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:91
msgid "Chunky Kit"
msgstr "どっしりキット"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:92
msgid "HEAVY LIFTING"
msgstr "力仕事"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:92
msgid "Pieces of 5 or more blocks score +10 Chips per block."
msgstr "5ブロック以上のピースは、1ブロックにつき+10チップ。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:93
msgid "A 19-piece bag of big, plump shapes: squares, Ts, pluses, a Bar 5 and a 3x3. Only 13 placements."
msgstr "大きくてずんぐりした形19個のバッグ:スクエア、T、プラス、バー5、3x3。配置は13回だけ。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:93
msgid "Defeat 3 bosses across runs."
msgstr "ラン通算でボスを3体倒す。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:94
msgid "Tetromino"
msgstr "テトロミノ"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:94
msgid "Tetromino Kit"
msgstr "テトロミノキット"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:95
msgid "+1 Credit every time a Tray Hand forms."
msgstr "トレイ役ができるたびに+1クレジット。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:95
msgid "FULL HOUSE"
msgstr "フルハウス"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:96
msgid "Form 25 Tray Hands across runs."
msgstr "ラン通算でトレイ役を25回作る。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:96
msgid "Only four-block pieces: 20 of them, so Twins and Triplets come often."
msgstr "4ブロックのピースだけ20個。ツインズやトリプレットがよくできる。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:103
msgid "Heat 0"
msgstr "ヒート0"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:103
msgid "Standard rules."
msgstr "標準ルール。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:104
msgid "Heat 1"
msgstr "ヒート1"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:104
#, c-format
msgid "Targets +15%."
msgstr "目標+15%。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:105
msgid "Heat 2"
msgstr "ヒート2"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:105
msgid "One fewer placement every round."
msgstr "毎ラウンドの配置回数が1回少ない。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:106
msgid "Heat 3"
msgstr "ヒート3"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:106
msgid "Interest pays at most +3; rerolls start at 3."
msgstr "利子は最大+3、リロールは3から。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:107
msgid "Every boss is its Mk II version."
msgstr "すべてのボスがMk II版になる。"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:107
msgid "Heat 4"
msgstr "ヒート4"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:108
msgid "Heat 5"
msgstr "ヒート5"

#: game/content/run_config.gd:108
#, c-format
msgid "Targets +35% and one fewer Refresh."
msgstr "目標+35%、リフレッシュが1回少ない。"

